\author{hakongylterud}
\author{fredrikbakke}
\title{Towards the representation theorem for polynomial endofunctors}
\import{stt-macros}

\p{
During the workshop, [Håkon](hakongylterud) worked on formalising the
representation theorem for
[polynomial endofunctors](Wild.PolynomialEndofunctors)/containers, using the
parametricity property of [the category of spaces](Synthetic.Categories.Spaces)
#{\SS}.
}

\subtree{
\title{Representation theorem for polynomial endofunctors}
\taxon{Theorem}
\p{
Between #{\SS}-valued polynomial endofunctors, morphisms and natural
transformations coincide.
}
}

\p{
We hope to resume this project again in the future.
}
